&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Elite Technology, we embrace an employee-centric, flexible work model that empowers you to do your best work in the environment that suits you. However, we also recognize the importance of in-person collaboration for key moments that truly matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In our flexible remote approach, you have the freedom to choose a workspace within your home country that best fits your needs. Our corporate offices are located in New York City, Los Angeles, Costa Rica, and the Philippines, providing additional options for those who prefer or need a hybrid work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our diverse global team spans the U.S., Canada, U.K., Costa Rica, the Philippines, and Australia. Please note that at this time, we are unable to hire employees located in Quebec or Ontario Provinces, Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, Louisiana, and Oklahoma&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As a global business, we rely on diversity of culture and thought to deliver on our goals. To ensure we can do that, we seek talented, qualified employees in all our operations around the world regardless of race, color, sex/gender, including pregnancy, gender identity and expression, national origin, religion, sexual orientation, disability, age, marital status, citizen status, veteran status, or any other protected classification under applicable law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity/Affirmative Action Employer providing a drug-free workplace.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We also provide reasonable accommodation for qualified individuals with disabilities and for sincerely held religious beliefs in accordance with applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are not accepting applications submitted through recruiting agencies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Product Manager to own our search experience that millions of customers land on when they open DoorDash, Wolt, or Deliveroo, and the single biggest lever we have on what they find.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role sits in our Core Consumer organisation in the Search domain, which is responsible for the in-app experience. You&#39;ll be building on a global stack, and your roadmap will be a mix: global platform problems that apply worldwide, global capabilities we&#39;re accelerating into EMEA markets, and EMEA-specific problems worth solving properly rather than working around.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Search is where customers tell us exactly what they want. Getting it right across restaurants, grocery, and retail - in every language we operate in - is one of the highest-intent and hardest problems in the app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll work on&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query understanding, Autosuggestions and AI/ML problems in the Search domain&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where conversational and agentic search changes how customers get to a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making search work across three brands, multiple languages, and query behaviour that differs market by market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a product leader more than a feature owner. Someone who can find the problems that matter most, for customers and for the business, and make the case for solving them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring proven experience as a Product Manager in Consumer, or on another relevance- or ranking-driven consumer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate fluency with search measurement and know how to actually move it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You show strong product judgment, backed by data literacy and customer insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work backwards from the customer problem, and you can weigh that against the most urgent business problems at the same time, rather than treating it as a side you have to pick.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think strategically: you can zoom out to where the domain should be in two years, then zoom back in on what we should ship next quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with ambiguity and genuinely flexible. This industry is changing fast, AI most of all, and the plan we write in January won&#39;t be the plan in June.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work deeply with ML and engineering on relevance and ranking, without needing to be an ML expert yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about what AI actually changes for customers, and you can tell real value from hype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build a case and bring people with you: engineering, design, analytics, and local market teams across three brands and many markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You do your best work with range: global platform thinking one week, a specific market&#39;s reality the next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will be filled as soon as we find the right person, so make sure to apply as soon as you realize you really, really want to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Training and serving frontier AI models requires data center capacity at a scale and pace that conventional delivery models were not built for. Anthropic&#39;s Data Center Capacity Delivery team embeds with developers, general contractors, and third-party partners to take leased and partnered sites from deal close through floor access and operational handover as fast as they can safely be built.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Regional Manager, you&#39;ll own delivery across a regional portfolio of active and upcoming projects. You&#39;ll build and lead the team of Senior Delivery Managers and third-party partners who sit on those sites, set the standards they execute to, and step in yourself where a project needs it. You are the executive-level interface to our developer partners in the region and the intake point for projects handed over from our transaction team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a highly cross-functional role: you&#39;ll work daily with our transaction, design engineering, facility operations and commissioning, deployment, and safety teams, and with developers, GCs, and owner&#39;s-representative firms on the ground.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MOC (Mission + Outcomes + Competencies)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliver the region’s data center projects to floor access as fast as they can safely be built.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every active project in the region delivered against early-floor-access and floor-access milestones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Senior Delivery Manager team hired and led; owner’s-rep partners contracted and managed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Delivery standards (schedule, quality, change control, reporting) enforced across the portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Executive reporting on progress vs plan and regional capacity projections in place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Senior owner- or GC-side mission-critical delivery leadership.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Builds and leads multi-project teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Executive-level developer and GC relationship management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Leads on site through presence; owns outcomes where no process exists.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead. This is a role where leadership trumps management and process. You are expected to be on the region&#39;s sites enough to shape the culture, approach, and aggressiveness that define the extended teams there — across the portfolio, not one project — and to impact outcomes in a favorable manner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Be a force multiplier. Hire, develop, empower, and lead the Senior Delivery Managers on those sites, and raise the skillset developers, contractors, owner&#39;s-rep partners, and key trades bring to every project in the region; plan resourcing and headcount as the portfolio grows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Own portfolio execution for the region — schedule, quality, and safety outcomes on every active project, measured against early-floor-access and floor-access milestones. You are empowered and have autonomy to own this regions record of performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive ownership and influence both inside and outside contractual structures: select, scope, contract, and manage owner&#39;s-rep and project-management partners; where contracts, incentives, or culture get in the way of speed, change them, and replace partners when performance or culture slips&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set and enforce delivery standards across projects — integrated schedule, quality requirements, change control, reporting, and tools — and validate that they are met&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Identify blockers early and clear them across developer, GC, and trade layers; step in on site where a project needs it&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have [10+] years delivering data center or other mission-critical construction, including several as the owner&#39;s or GC&#39;s senior leader on a project campus&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have led a multi-project portfolio and built the team that delivered it&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Know the end-to-end development process — entitlements and permitting, design, long-lead equipment, construction, commissioning, and handover — well enough to direct partners rather than take their word for it&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have managed developer, GC, and third-party relationships at the executive level and can move them from arm&#39;s-length contract administration to shared urgency&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead through presence: you expect to be on site most of the time and to set the pace and culture of extended teams you don&#39;t directly employ&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Communicate clearly with technical and non-specialist stakeholders and hold a position when challenged&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are comfortable with ambiguity and with owning outcomes where no process exists yet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may also have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hyperscale data center delivery experience on the owner, developer, or GC side&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with the UK and continental European market — its contractors, permitting regimes, and contractual norms&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with lease, construction, and development contract structures and how to align their incentives around speed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£1 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

