&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a team of 5-8 AI engineers, fostering a culture of technical excellence, innovation, and delivery&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Drive end-to-end execution of conversational AI features that enable users to interact with Anaplan models through&amp;nbsp;natural language&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Oversee the development of agentic AI systems that can autonomously analyse data, generate insights, and execute planning workflows&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Own the team&#39;s delivery roadmap, working closely with product management to prioritise features and manage technical trade-offs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Establish engineering best practices for AI development, including testing strategies, evaluation frameworks, and deployment patterns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Lead sprint planning, technical design reviews, and retrospectives to ensure consistent delivery velocity and&amp;nbsp;quality&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Collaborate with AI Solutions Architects to translate architectural vision into executable engineering plans&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build and maintain CI/CD pipelines for AI applications, including automated testing and prompt regression suites&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Partner with platform teams to ensure AI features integrate seamlessly with Anaplan&#39;s core infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Communicate progress, risks, and technical decisions to senior leadership and cross-functional stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Software engineering experience while leading engineering teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience building and deploying AI applications in production&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of LLM APIs, prompt engineering, and conversational AI patterns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience with agentic frameworks and autonomous agent architectures&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Proficiency&amp;nbsp;in Python and modern software development practices (testing, code review, CI/CD)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of delivering complex technical projects on time with high quality&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strong project management skills with experience using Agile/Scrum methodologies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
